OL,3,GNEWSA'Mummy's death was preventable,   
OL,4,Ashe was robbed of her future'          
OL,6,FThe Belfast Trust said they wish to    
OL,7,F"apologise unreservedly to the family  
OL,8,Fof Mrs Diamond", adding significant    
OL,9,Flearning has been taken from a review  
OL,10,Fof the care she received.              
